## About the standard

Open catalogue of security and privacy controls.

The control and requirement statements below are reproduced in English from the publisher’s open data.

Official source: [NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 5](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/53/r5/upd1/final).

